From: TicWatch Pro 5 port
Subject: [PATCH] opp: tolerate missing ICC providers (dace bring-up)

dev_pm_opp_of_find_icc_paths devolvia -EPROBE_DEFER cuando el provider ICC
(qnoc-monaco) no estaba cargado -> sdhci/kgsl/drm/geni en deferred y sin eMMC.
Sin qnoc (su registro dispara un reset duro a EDL, causa pendiente), los paths
ICC quedan vacios y los drivers corren sin bw-voting (bus con rates del ABL).
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [dace bring-up]
---

diff --git a/drivers/opp/of.c b/drivers/opp/of.c
index 3028353af..f7f27ada2 100644
--- a/drivers/opp/of.c
+++ b/drivers/opp/of.c
@@ -491,12 +491,16 @@ int dev_pm_opp_of_find_icc_paths(struct device *dev,
 	for (i = 0; i < num_paths; i++) {
 		paths[i] = of_icc_get_by_index(dev, i);
 		if (IS_ERR(paths[i])) {
-			ret = PTR_ERR(paths[i]);
-			if (ret != -EPROBE_DEFER) {
-				dev_err(dev, "%s: Unable to get path%d: %d\n",
-					__func__, i, ret);
-			}
-			goto err;
+			/* dace bring-up: el qnoc-monaco no esta cargado (su
+			 * registro dispara un reset duro a EDL). Dejar los paths
+			 * ICC vacios en vez de deferir: los drivers probean sin
+			 * bw-voting (el bus queda con los rates del bootloader).
+			 * Los consumidores toleran path==NULL (sdhci-msm ya lo
+			 * hace: 'Failed to get bus_scale data' es no-fatal). */
+			dev_info(dev, "%s: icc path%d no disponible (%ld) - sin bw-voting\n",
+				__func__, i, PTR_ERR(paths[i]));
+			kfree(paths);
+			return 0;
 		}
 	}
 
